{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026CXGw8fEKTl1794969487.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[10:14更新]</p><p>港鐵：現時為非繁忙時間，港島綫往堅尼地城方向的列車服務恢復行駛正常班次；而往柴灣方向的列車服務，整體行車時間調整至需要額外3至5分鐘。港鐵人員正處理相關信號設備故障。</p><p></p><p>[08:49]</p><p>港鐵香港大學站附近，有信號設備故障。</p><p></p><p>列車行經時要慢駛，港島綫來往堅尼地城站至柴灣站整體行車時間要額外5至8分鐘。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T03:04:34.184688+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T02:14:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T02:57:56.774628+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T02:57:56.774628+00:00","content_hash":"0e8aa5c7e5e8e8991663fc9556c3ebd54c0c7edb239b14599273e21f5ec6245c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}